Bundled language grammars
==========================

opencode ships syntect's 75 default grammars plus these extras:

  TOML        — upstream grammar, MIT.
                https://github.com/jasonwilliams/sublime_toml_highlighting

  DotENV      — authored for opencode (MIT). Minimal .env grammar.
  INI         — authored for opencode (MIT). Sections / key=value / comments.
  Dockerfile  — authored for opencode (MIT). Instructions / strings / vars.

Add your own: drop a `.sublime-syntax` file into
  ~/.config/opencode/syntaxes/   (or $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/opencode/syntaxes/)
and it is compiled into the syntax set at startup.
